  "Maintenance is where you keep track of looking after the cabin: log things that need doing, plan and follow up the work, run inspections, and look back at what's been done. It's organised in three tabs — Structures (the buildings), Infrastructure (things like the water supply, road or septic system) and Equipment.": "Maintenance is where you keep track of looking after the cabin: log things that need doing, plan and follow up the work, run inspections, and look back at what's been done. It's organised in three tabs — Structures (the buildings), Infrastructure (things like the water supply, road or septic system) and Equipment.",
  "Pick a tab and open an item": "Pick a tab and open an item",
  "Choose Structures, Infrastructure or Equipment, then find the building, system or piece of equipment you want to work on. Each one has its own card.": "Choose Structures, Infrastructure or Equipment, then find the building, system or piece of equipment you want to work on. Each one has its own card.",
  "Log a task": "Log a task",
